            <li>Ultra-fast processing speeds</li>
            <li>Power-efficient technology</li>
            <li>AI acceleration built-in</li>
            <li>Advanced security features</li>
          </ul>
          <button class="product-btn">Learn More</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5G Modem -->
      <div class="product-card fade-in">
        <div class="product-image">🌐</div>
        <div class="product-info">
          <span class="product-category">Connectivity</span>
          <h3 class="product-name">5G Modem Solutions</h3>
          <p class="product-description">Next-generation 5G modems enabling ultra-fast connectivity, lower latency, and massive IoT device support.</p>
          <ul class="product-features">
            <li>Sub-6 GHz technology</li>
            <li>Millimeter Wave support</li>
            <li>IoT connectivity</li>
            <li>Global standards compliance</li>
          </ul>
          <button class="product-btn">Learn More</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RF Solutions -->
      <div class="product-card fade-in">
        <div class="product-image">⚡</div>
        <div class="product-info">
          <span class="product-category">RF Front-End</span>
          <h3 class="product-name">RF Front-End Solutions</h3>
          <p class="product-description">Advanced radio frequency front-end modules for optimal signal transmission and reception in any environment.</p>
          <ul class="product-features">
            <li>Multi-band support</li>
            <li>High integration levels</li>
            <li>Low power consumption</li>
            <li>Compact form factors</li>
          </ul>
          <button class="product-btn">Learn More</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- IoT Platform -->
      <div class="product-card fade-in">
        <div class="product-image">🏠</div>
        <div class="product-info">
          <span class="product-category">IoT Solutions</span>
          <h3 class="product-name">IoT Platforms</h3>
          <p class="product-description">Complete IoT solutions for smart cities, industrial automation, and connected devices with cloud integration.</p>
          <ul class="product-features">
            <li>Edge computing support</li>
            <li>Cloud connectivity</li>
            <li>Security protocols</li>
            <li>Scalable architecture</li>
          </ul>
          <button class="product-btn">Learn More</button>
        </div>
